# My First Website

A simple and clean web project built with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.  
This project was created as part of my learning journey in web development and is designed to be easy to understand, reuse, and extend during hackathons.

## 🚀 Live Demo
Check out the deployed version here:  
👉 [BCA Study Hub KP](https://bca-study-hub-kp.web.app/)

## 📂 Features
- Responsive layout for desktop and mobile
- Organized structure with separate HTML, CSS, and JS files
- Beginner‑friendly codebase for quick reuse
- Ready to deploy on Firebase Hosting

## 🛠️ Tech Stack
- **Frontend:** HTML, CSS, JavaScript
- **Hosting:** Firebase

